│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ reduce_overregularization_add_regime_change_features                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The current model is severely over-regularized (min_child_weight=12, reg_lambda=5.0),     │
│                          │ which has collapsed both train and val slopes to near-zero. This is worse than all prior  │
│                          │ attempts.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ 1. **Hyperparameters**: Reduce regularization to allow learning. Increase n_estimators    │
│                          │ and learning_rate to compensate. This mirrors the -1.62 attempt which had better slope.   │
│                          │ 2. **New regime-change features**: Add volatility-of-volatility (vol_accel),              │
│                          │ momentum-of-momentum (mom_accel_2), and autocorrelation trend to detect when market       │
│                          │ character is shifting. These measure the RATE OF CHANGE of market properties, not just    │
│                          │ current state.                                                                            │
│                          │ 3. **Adaptive z-scoring**: Normalize key features within shorter rolling windows (10-20   │
│                          │ bars) to make them regime-invariant while preserving signal.                              │
│                          │ 4. **Remove weak features**: Drop some of the longest-lookback features (sma_40, atr_20)  │
│                          │ that don't generalize across regimes.                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Target: val_slope >= 0.015, pred_std_ratio >= 0.12, val_DA >= 0.53                        │
