│                          │ 3. Adding short-term autocorrelation and volume z-scores to capture changes in market     │
│                          │ character (mean-reversion vs trending).                                                   │
│                          │ 4. Adjusting the target clipping (97th percentile) and minimum prediction standard        │
│                          │ deviation ratio (0.18) to improve the model's signal-to-noise handling and expressivity.  │
